   4S6P) and the usable Wh it adds to the both-kept 4S9P lid at its 13.23 C, corrected path NOM, TYP, HF available
     48 h no tablet budget                         lid 4S11.16P, +68.1 Wh usable
     48 h budget, window 13 to 15 UTC              lid 4S11.16P, +68.1 Wh usable
