7. BATTERY-ONLY ENDURANCE with the budget (no solar), to the kit's shutdown, both packs at +20 C then at -10 C, as
   runtime.out 1 (A35 there: 544.4 / 224.5 Wh, 12.71 / 5.24 h). In a window schedule the hours depend on whether the
   day's window falls inside the run: 'window in the run' charges the day's 38.7 Wh at VBAT to the store, 'window after'
   does not (the tablet then runs on its own battery). The options' stores add the section 6 extra (TYP) as an
   external store, its Wh taken as usable at +20 C and x 0.4124 at -10 C (runtime.py's cold factor, INFERRED)
