END. The budget is a PROPOSAL; nothing is measured. No result here is demonstrated capability: the circuit as drawn
fails; the corrected path is HYPOTHETICAL and CONDITIONAL on three undocumented efficiencies; external packs are a
PROPOSAL whose join (D-20's DC entry, EQ-13 (b), or VBAT, reopening D-06, EQ-13 (d)) is not designed.
